      "contents": "<div class=\"se-viewer se-theme-default\" lang=\"ko-KR\">\n    <!-- SE_DOC_HEADER_START -->\n    <!--@CONTENTS_HEADER-->\n    <!-- SE_DOC_HEADER_END -->\n    <div class=\"se-main-container\">\n                <div class=\"se-component se-image se-l-default\" id=\"SE-ec4c5bcb-89c2-41e3-b42c-268b3745b554\">\n                    <div class=\"se-component-content se-component-content-normal\">\n                        <div class=\"se-section se-section-image se-l-default se-section-align-justify\" style=\"max-width:800px;\">\n                                <div class=\"se-module se-module-image\" style=\"\">\n                                    <a href=\"#\" class=\"se-module-image-link __se_image_link __se_link\" style=\"\" onclick=\"return false;\" data-linktype=\"img\" data-linkdata='{\"id\" : \"SE-ec4c5bcb-89c2-41e3-b42c-268b3745b554\", \"src\" : \"https://nng-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyNDExMDVfMjI5/MDAxNzMwODAxODQ2MTg5.varyqJE45ZGd7GQuF_toRxkW_P_XA7i_xkHAVBkmAuQg.ZuSaVMPvtvywd_HclI22gw7yTRyE71uNid1dGOlXVJwg.PNG/%EC%97%85%EB%8D%B0%EC%9D%B4%ED%8A%B8_800x150.png?type=w1678\", \"originalWidth\" : \"800\", \"originalHeight\" : \"236\", \"linkUse\" : \"false\", \"link\" : \"\"}'>\n                                        <img src=\"https://nng-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyNDExMDVfMjI5/MDAxNzMwODAxODQ2MTg5.varyqJE45ZGd7GQuF_toRxkW_P_XA7i_xkHAVBkmAuQg.ZuSaVMPvtvywd_HclI22gw7yTRyE71uNid1dGOlXVJwg.PNG/%EC%97%85%EB%8D%B0%EC%9D%B4%ED%8A%B8_800x150.png?type=w1678\" alt=\"\" class=\"se-image-resource\" />\n                                    </a>\n                                </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"se-component se-text se-l-default\" id=\"SE-864afe09-e3a3-44f9-a2bb-8078dd56396e\">\n                    <div class=\"se-component-content\">\n                        <div class=\"se-section se-section-text se-l-default\">\n                            <div class=\"se-module se-module-text\">\n                                    <!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-94a6f91f-eead-4b4e-a744-55d447c32e68\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-758be004-750c-4985-93e2-f80324501a60\">안녕하세요. 세계 탈환 판타지! </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-e3258316-6f78-419e-abb7-446587ede440\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-4ffa9843-0305-42e9-ad6b-ca6580478dcd\">원 핸드 모바일 슈팅 게임, ​</span><span style=\"color:#0070C0;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-f40aa3a1-18c5-4440-aee0-5facceca7576\"><b>승리의 여신: 니케</b></span><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-37b32d80-bfad-40b1-9401-f65b9fab5a8f\">​입니다.​​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-790348e0-307d-4e59-8ed1-a82660c6e125\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-d5250166-6169-4025-9db7-23569dac2251\"> </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-acf5542f-9ddb-4ef6-ae55-2db3565c964f\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-09217b8a-7a9c-4583-aa31-735c8378fff7\">11/7(목), 업데이트를 위한 서버 점검이 진행될 예정입니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-b3915b9e-cb56-46eb-8a40-d61a5f12fdf5\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-ffa16ab9-f3dc-4b14-bec1-2922af0e3df0\"> </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-97b548f4-8feb-429e-a939-bcdf8bfa2485\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-2f9fa04d-86c5-4eff-bb86-e131a9250fd3\">​점검 진행 전 데이터 손실 방지를 위해</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-eb711068-2183-4b3e-916c-ece47d8cd0b4\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-351f0fe2-183c-4462-bb4d-9740f0618fa1\">미리 접속을 종료해 주시길 바랍니다.​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-b5b3979d-b954-49c5-8af0-09b4c7b352a7\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-71c5a9d9-67d8-45e3-a5d0-083a713f0ae9\"> </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-a7013e59-b7ec-47b7-8505-78dfc83d8f87\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-6ce8e7e3-6782-4cf9-aa23-5b66740972ef\">자세한 내용은 아래를 확인 부탁드립니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-41247ad4-6eb6-4605-8dfe-b54b0bc85fe7\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-94f656a7-7898-443b-8ad1-ef0968b7c262\">·····················································································</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-8698585a-bf41-4fdc-940d-69a57df4dd06\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-0dbf2a7d-2e22-424d-8820-a280de849645\"><b>📢 11월 7일(목) 업데이트 소식 사전 안내</b></span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-511c1880-b977-4820-b7d7-ff840a9bdfdb\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-4bd509f3-cdf0-4606-b4df-d1611a2c2bc7\"> </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-15974f73-17ea-4367-878f-3f3c8740ce7c\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-c3c2a2fa-a26b-4e68-a021-fded784d0aad\">​</span><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-3f73d79a-bfdf-4832-bd2a-a38ba927abba\"><b>✔️ 점검 일시</b></span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-a3320f2b-df7a-42fe-beaa-2f168cc13b72\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-d7d65472-9cf8-4bd4-9aaf-ecbd30149b7d\">- 11월 7일(목) 00:00:00 ~ </span><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-dba0c653-e6fc-4fd3-89c3-6fd394b7b45c\"><strike>5:00:00</strike></span><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-8312e3bb-c217-4270-a27f-0ff77d1789ff\"> 4:00:00</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-2bb41c4e-252a-457b-99e3-d468cdb6613d\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-43f82580-bb3c-40be-aa42-8338c2ccddd2\">※ 점검 시간은 상황에 따라 연장 및 단축될 수 있습니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-37a93e24-c461-4907-aca0-82a4e52619ed\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-8b397934-d2d4-4bcc-9ace-c15b35fc4321\"> </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-4fa86042-1843-4be7-b2ab-378cc78bc385\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-3a51f682-97fb-444e-9b9d-02efb57b443d\"><b>✔️ 점검 보상</b></span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-d74a7295-5fb9-494f-8f24-2acd7f9b8d39\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-e0a4bcf7-c3b2-47ca-a3fb-a7a6a06f76d8\">- 300 쥬얼</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-79dfa19c-bf3d-4daf-ad0c-c940b055eedb\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-97b2b659-9dec-40f2-8659-237acd98b335\"> </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-672727dc-965d-492a-9aa6-528326c5e544\"><span style=\"color:#C00000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-545e4e8b-b49d-4e40-9755-441b54ddeaf9\"><b>🚨 주의사항</b></span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-483e5827-b3e4-447a-ac79-cdbc575a1cea\"><span style=\"color:#C00000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-24538940-3c73-4095-b8b8-a361febfbe28\">- 점검 진행 중에는 서버 접속이 불가능한 점 양해 부탁드립니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-5b23d022-c8f8-4663-8323-a26a37d86405\"><span style=\"color:#C00000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-7598e421-6bbc-4e97-a486-268f11e09619\">- 원활한 점검을 위해 진행 전 접속을 종료해 주시기 바랍니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-a98afec9-bd11-4ff0-aefb-5a8984c0363b\"><span style=\"color:#C00000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-3f86dc7a-cdcc-4993-bb1f-e4ec4107ee3a\">- 업데이트 후 스토어에서 최신 버전 클라이언트 다운로드를 부탁드립니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-3eb98fe9-319e-4822-8ba8-7bfcfd538ec5\"><span style=\"color:#C00000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-649a060a-7883-4b92-98c7-01adce66f0a7\">- 신규 클라이언트 다운로드를 위해 디바이스 내 최소 5GB 이상의 저장 공간 확보를 권장드리며, &lt;승리의 여신: 니케&gt; 게임을 처음 설치하시는 신규 지휘관님께서는 최소 10GB 이상의 저장 공간을 확보해 주시기를 권장해 드립니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-995d2cf9-7f1b-452e-b642-093c2da1c084\"><span style=\"color:#C00000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-1f416c34-15c7-4804-88cf-c459a5170394\">- PC 버전의 경우, Launcher에서 [게임 시작] 버튼을 클릭하면 최신 클라이언트로 업데이트가 진행됩니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-4a24cae6-42a5-4287-b70b-20c588d3127e\"><span style=\"color:#C00000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-610ac9aa-f94f-462c-995b-0885a7481a34\">- 리소스 파일 다운로드 과정에서 게임 앱을 강제 종료하는 경우 클라이언트 리소스 다운로드에 실패할 수 있사오니, 다운로드 중에는 게임 앱을 강제 종료하지 않도록 주의해 주시길 부탁드립니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-c6e43467-2d74-436d-ae61-289655a689c6\"><span style=\"color:#C00000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-92638d56-f83a-4af5-81dd-985957d78b7a\">- 내부 사정에 따라 업데이트 내용 및 점검 일정이 변동될 수 있으며, 변동 시 본 공지 사항을 통해 안내해드리겠습니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-319f1aaf-d382-469d-91f9-9637bc85a1e4\"><span style=\"color:#C00000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-ea46c0c5-f2a8-4f60-9ee7-bccfbf73aa0f\">- 점검 종료 후 연장되는 시간에 따라 점검 보상이 추가로 지급됩니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-63ab1540-a006-4a67-8713-369d923a900f\"><span style=\"color:#C00000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-5092ffb9-1fc9-4632-b788-d9d43cfe573b\">- 점검 보상은 점검 종료 후 계정당 1회 지급되며, 네트워크 지연 등으로 인해 지급이 지연될 수 있습니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT -->\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>                <div class=\"se-component se-horizontalLine se-l-line1\" id=\"SE-19821ceb-8f23-4050-b457-2b7f52391681\">\n                    <div class=\"se-component-content\">\n                        <div class=\"se-section se-section-horizontalLine se-l-line1 se-section-align-justify\">\n                            <div class=\"se-module se-module-horizontalLine\">\n                                <hr class=\"se-hr\" />\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>                <div class=\"se-component se-image se-l-default\" id=\"SE-266dc523-d822-4e47-9f3b-05b091e58db0\">\n                    <div class=\"se-component-content se-component-content-normal\">\n                        <div class=\"se-section se-section-image se-l-default se-section-align-justify\" style=\"max-width:700px;\">\n                                <div class=\"se-module se-module-image\" style=\"\">\n                                    <a href=\"#\" class=\"se-module-image-link __se_image_link __se_link\" style=\"\" onclick=\"return false;\" data-linktype=\"img\" data-linkdata='{\"id\" : \"SE-266dc523-d822-4e47-9f3b-05b091e58db0\", \"src\" : \"https://nng-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyNDExMDdfNzUg/MDAxNzMwOTE3NDE5NjA4.xust_30lVDlAajO7xPpBcwjn7D72HqNzQRonlezwpV4g.duVi50P2UGSeXQuT_IKkYN4ZhYC3jestYpSCEF4lbK0g.PNG/%EC%97%85%EB%8D%B0%EC%9D%B4%ED%8A%B8%EB%9D%A0%EB%B0%B0%EB%84%88_orange_04.png?type=w1678\", \"originalWidth\" : \"700\", \"originalHeight\" : \"50\", \"linkUse\" : \"false\", \"link\" : \"\"}'>\n                                        <img src=\"https://nng-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyNDExMDdfNzUg/MDAxNzMwOTE3NDE5NjA4.xust_30lVDlAajO7xPpBcwjn7D72HqNzQRonlezwpV4g.duVi50P2UGSeXQuT_IKkYN4ZhYC3jestYpSCEF4lbK0g.PNG/%EC%97%85%EB%8D%B0%EC%9D%B4%ED%8A%B8%EB%9D%A0%EB%B0%B0%EB%84%88_orange_04.png?type=w1678\" alt=\"\" class=\"se-image-resource\" />\n                                    </a>\n                                </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"se-component se-text se-l-default\" id=\"SE-e1e3da94-d6c0-4323-9cb2-36a508bcadf5\">\n                    <div class=\"se-component-content\">\n                        <div class=\"se-section se-section-text se-l-default\">\n                            <div class=\"se-module se-module-text\">\n                                    <!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-12d3b96f-7bbc-4fe7-a310-800c475a4a06\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-715cf4d3-fc54-4b49-aaac-8bd23a54be0a\"><b>1. 솔로 레이드</b></span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-f41a03a7-9343-4fd6-9176-2b5407d82f83\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-ac2133b2-0576-40f7-ad07-66c429f9aef1\">- 다수의 파티를 사용하여 보스에 도전하고 큐브 재료와 애장품 및 소장품 재료를 보상으로 획득할 수 있습니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-ec940609-9fce-4c5a-91a5-6aaaea9413fb\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-d335a345-2855-44d7-87cb-e8494782e5bf\">- 도전 난이도는 가장 높은 누적 피해량을 기준으로 랭킹 순위가 결정되며 순위에 따라 한정 프레임, 쥬얼을 획득할 수 있습니다.​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-0b44214c-d872-4de3-b2d4-67387a577ae6\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-ccc986ff-22b7-4321-8910-f32e9898aae1\"> </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-3c14d19c-3e20-404f-941a-7fe278d19e45\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-654414b7-e0a0-412b-8dee-8ad16c7a0d38\"><b>▶ 이벤트 진행 기간 : </b></span><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-na