text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-a16792e7-8ce1-481c-bad5-8d150147454f\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic se-weight-unset se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-3e0d3624-c072-4881-8375-7b3088849281\">└ Lv10: 최종 공격력 682.96% 대미지 -&gt; 최종 공격력 1365.92% 대미지</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-06ba09a8-c20c-4fff-9327-5c02f3208da7\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic se-weight-unset se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-648e2099-c857-488f-b5dc-0f29a6b50283\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-cf60ad05-f3be-4642-9da3-8bf989fbf35d\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-30023140-4d83-45be-b4c4-78e190a4b6a8\">2) 미니 게임 IN THE MIRROR의 특정 지역 진입 시 점프 조작이 불가능한 현상을 수정하였습니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-c5493e07-e7e9-4748-9a5d-aaac050f67d5\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-d4f7c912-486a-41e7-ad26-09aea55da568\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-a221abcf-34ea-41e6-96ad-5cf465f42adc\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-373c00cc-395b-4634-8d51-78494c5a4071\">3) 미니 게임 IN THE MIRROR에서 특정 아이템의 획득처가 잘못 표기되는 현상을 수정하였습니다. </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-4f43ff18-a0f0-4196-9674-20b3e4d0f57b\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-10ae4296-b26c-49be-913b-a481772c43da\"> [기존]</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-9eef14cf-7fdd-4a5d-8e81-7f89c799d26c\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-f9e52edd-7360-4609-a447-73acfc085e8e\"> └ 메인 미션 [거대 랩쳐 &lt;식스 핸드&gt;]를 클리어하여 획득</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-25e665c9-f419-4fb5-b975-f134bddf96da\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-5e8a9fab-e96d-4533-8a78-7e9c04bf4c44\"> [변경]</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-e2f5ad46-f12f-42ce-92a5-038a9af9edd0\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-2f8a3a4f-7271-4d5b-9a3a-e07e813ed9fb\"> └ 메인 미션 [거대 랩쳐 &lt;식스 핸드&gt;]를 클리어 후 [죽음으로 가는 길]에서 획득</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-486d27e4-64c6-4d6d-af6e-2b3ceae189b1\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-19556f2b-274b-4961-8e81-02de727903de\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-3b2539e5-3dbc-4fb7-bf7f-0964cea517ef\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-23a135b5-cd64-4976-8223-bd07c043287d\">4) 캠페인 33 챕터 시나리오 「2세대 페어리 테일：B」의 특정 장면에서 효과음이 재생되지 않는 현상을 수정하였습니다. </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-97c15579-2580-408d-9c21-922e560ec2ef\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-140dbfae-6d54-4294-b6a5-2ac6af1e813d\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-d076b86c-0094-420c-ad42-e76ec02aa7e7\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-4d1c0fcd-061b-4209-a36c-38dffd506f19\">5) 미니 게임 IN THE MIRROR에서 획득할 수 있는 일일 미션 보상이 없는 경우에도 게임 내 미션 아이콘에 레드닷이 표시되는 현상을 수정하였습니다. </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-2351d794-e8bb-460e-9d52-ef52348f702f\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-410b3e07-2198-4213-919d-f19743db2589\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-631cd7d7-fbe4-4420-893f-ee4407121906\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-7441f239-e1bf-48b2-9c42-24ddebd55bb3\">6) 특정 PC 환경에서 미니 게임의 단축키 조작이 불가능한 현상을 수정하였습니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-dda38755-c9c2-42b0-83fc-b5842e6adf77\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-32935887-e41b-443e-91cf-3c5caf54a390\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-4ca45c59-ef05-4922-a148-49c3554b451d\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-8a833d2d-033d-4bf9-b2a0-f2ff90d28ae1\">7) OLD TALES 이벤트 필드에서 상호작용 시 특정 조건에 따라 조작이 불가능해지는 현상을 수정하였습니다. </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-baa73bd6-8658-499e-9ab2-d4c343060c72\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-31f9da4c-71ac-442f-b07c-7b9a55fd7873\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-f58897a0-6912-469b-a0bb-5b36575b4c0a\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-b010a7a1-2b75-4046-bd39-de24a305ddc9\">8) 미니 게임 IN THE MIRROR에서 일일 미션 보상 획득 시, 일부 일일 미션의 진행도가 특정 시점으로 되돌아가는 현상을 수정하였습니다.</span><span style=\"color:#0078cb;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-22455f28-d016-4f22-a4c9-1d17e3da8a27\"><b>(11/7(목) 내용 추가)</b></span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-1b2ddbf7-b66e-46a8-92ef-09833901797e\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-b5930065-2929-470d-a51e-a4dfcffa6db7\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-5e30606b-fe93-474d-99b0-fab24fe0e11f\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-ca92b9a2-30a1-4a68-9e6b-c0ffe38f80a1\">9) 미니 게임 IN THE MIRROR의 일부 모듈이 의도와 다르게 작동하는 현상을 수정하였습니다. </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-52d76b78-a5c8-4c88-8a06-0df12eb2803b\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-b28d36d0-6396-4744-8617-eeec724403b2\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-8810c370-f6a3-44f8-b893-f72fb197a6dd\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-dc9d1a2e-4d08-4be2-8af6-6a8ff4204505\">10) 일부 언어의 로컬라이징 이슈를 수정하였습니다. </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-a67665e3-d01b-437c-9c76-d4528613dc29\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-441f1bcb-6e26-401a-8868-7890408742ff\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-aa704352-d7e5-40c6-b407-a7a9f9c293c1\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-2efb4324-e47e-496e-b966-2fff7bd981ad\">11) 베스티의 버스트</span><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-system   \" id=\"SE-d14d39c0-3fef-4b05-9acc-03992dfcc70f\"> </span><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-28619d1f-effc-4c92-83d3-42fdcfb62e28\">스킬</span><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-system   \" id=\"SE-0fbf05ae-225e-4c06-bb5a-c3ace6ee8c07\"> </span><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-dba0b5de-1eda-4bd7-886d-16197656ac37\">「정당방위」가</span><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-system   \" id=\"SE-79665ed8-4dfe-4b05-9a45-27d8f6dab00f\"> </span><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-52fe7d80-5a2a-45ed-bc39-be62cf7b1d16\">기존과</span><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-system   \" id=\"SE-1609a0b0-351c-4706-9c36-f298c229a294\"> </span><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-0f4db90c-968b-48ec-815b-dbc233cd6b36\">다르게</span><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-system   \" id=\"SE-8b3a9c7c-9270-49bd-9197-421e79d6d587\"> </span><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-c4ed3bc0-ced4-4831-a650-a85b91be2886\">작동하는</span><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-system   \" id=\"SE-afc6f482-42b9-49d8-9565-cb2d314573d6\"> </span><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-2adb2d2e-354e-48dd-b5c8-f402f5e1283a\">현상을</span><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-system   \" id=\"SE-ef33ee42-f9c6-493a-a7b1-c3ab37094300\"> </span><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-45edf323-5b6f-4c8f-a74b-cc662a39e7e6\">수정하였습니다</span><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-system   \" id=\"SE-ca795dc3-6377-440c-a7f9-78a329c52acd\">. </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-70121c75-e84f-41ed-8a7c-45716f5024f5\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-9f58594b-0d59-43d0-999f-89484635c775\"><b>​</b></span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-d691ec9f-ad1b-4bb4-aaff-77934174065a\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-fe497cd3-f5af-414f-a9fb-f77b0cd4fb1f\">12) 미니 게임 IN THE MIRROR에서 [죄가 잠든 관] 지역의 일부 세이브 포인트가 미니맵에 표시되지 않는 현상을 수정하였습니다.</span><span style=\"color:#0078cb;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-365d869b-a0a1-4fa7-92f5-31b19ad9e265\"><b>(11/7(목) 내용 추가)</b></span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-736ecc82-670a-4a37-bdb5-147081a0b494\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-46b4eee6-06f9-4ece-af5f-301e6b829cf7\"><b>​</b></span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-0bfa8072-0120-4351-be1c-ee08c56a2ca1\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-f8ecc98f-742e-4b2e-8e29-f7def4575991\">13) 미니 게임 IN THE MIRROR의 미니맵에 불필요한 이미지가 표시되는 현상을 수정하였습니다.</span><span style=\"color:#0078cb;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-40ca7ab7-7e87-46da-8452-ace795bd11dc\"><b>(11/7(목) 내용 추가)</b></span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-950a24ae-e82f-45e8-8838-77327b86337e\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-923939ea-cf93-4ef2-b2f1-4dc674f60792\"><b>​</b></span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-1443552a-53fa-474b-83a6-40bc1f0b4a7a\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-a21da4a3-3844-4544-b292-215414682db1\">14) 미니 게임 IN THE MIRROR의 특정 지역에서 낙하 시 게임오버가 되지 않는 현상을 </span><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-3075f2a1-9713-45d7-9df3-96fe8173ba80\">수정하였습니다.</span><span style=\"color:#0078cb;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-7be4da6c-af4f-4b70-a763-dfb6fa5715df\"><b>(11/7(목) 내용 추가)</b></span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-b328ca8a-6ffc-4bca-9f47-5922bb3fb9a9\"><span style=\"color:#0078cb;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-9c241d89-2d85-4615-b253-961568a9f072\"><b>​</b></span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-1f27aa74-8da9-41bd-bc63-f9de21f9c8f6\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-66cfd6d4-e678-4ed1-865d-eacc315b55b2\">15) OLD TALES 이벤트 필드 및 시나리오에 등장하는 도로시의 의상이 설정과 맞지 않는 현상을 수정하였습니다.</span><span style=\"color:#0078cb;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-03c85bed-673d-4fca-a192-4ec919187caa\"><b>(11/7(목) 내용 추가)</b></span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-622de07a-794d-44b5-8252-fdf6c57471d7\"><span style=\"color:#0078cb;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-f5537f2d-7e4b-4d1a-a052-a8bf923495ec\"><b>​</b></span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-73e62239-07dc-4928-bdfd-763fbc17b62e\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-37f556b4-8bb7-4b0d-8d11-2389960d1723\">16) PVE 전투 중 신데렐라의 조준 상태를 좀 더 쉽게 파악할 수 있도록 조준 UI를 개선하였습니다.</span><span style=\"color:#0078cb;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-f33dac4b-2f62-4cad-9849-14f5bd9f3d4a\"><b>(11/7(목) 내용 추가)</b></span><span style=\"color:#0078cb;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-80434b54-2f5c-41c5-8dc9-d6cb1d909d3b\"> </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-58cc2806-7e4b-48fb-8597-0f8caedddf92\"><span style=\"color:#0078cb;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-8834cd07-5c96-44a8-b8b1-e18fd4ff60a4\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-c6bc3c4a-13ec-44f8-837e-132d28bd2dc0\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-e47843d0-11e1-4a1a-aa92-12ddbdda7ba9\">17) 베히모스의 특정 스킬이 엄폐 중인 니케에게 대미지를 입히는 현상을 수정하였습니다.</span><span style=\"color:#0078cb;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-043eaa6b-c0a9-4870-8799-f7775d7fb4e4\"><b>(11/7(목) 내용 추가)</b></span><span style=\"color:#0078cb;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-1c4b8b29-6023-4039-a1cd-c28afcd08088\"> </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-8e62db79-8a4d-48d2-8a5e-0427f968dace\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-30fe4dc0-0184-41f6-bf22-67da30da6398\">·····················································································</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-726a00fb-2af0-4ab3-a468-6e4ffe82862c\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-4aa4127d-eaf8-47c9-b21c-d36e69b71d72\"> </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-8ee8